  VALUE: REQ-MCP-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MCP-005
TITLE: sync_mcp_servers — Orchestrate Full MCP Sync
STATEMENT: >>>
Main MCP sync orchestration:
  1. Load MCP registry
  2. Resolve active servers
  3. For each provider: generate rules + config
  4. Generate secrets template
  5. Validate secrets
Return: summary {synced_servers, secrets_needed, errors}.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Orchestration ensures consistent MCP deployment across all providers.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_mcp.py::test_sync_mcp_servers_e2e
<<<
TAGS: mcp, sync, orchestration
STATUS: Active
PRIORITY: P1
OWNER: @daniel
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: calls
  VALUE: REQ-MCP-001, REQ-MCP-002, REQ-MCP-003, REQ-MCP-004, REQ-MCP-006
- TYPE: called-by
  VALUE: REQ-SYNC-001

